        {
          "id": 26,
          "title": "Reading the signals",
          "type": "text",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 16,
            "y": 29,
            "w": 8,
            "h": 7
          },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### Each drive reports different fields\nATA sector counters apply to the hard drives. NVMe error and endurance fields apply to the SSD. Unsupported metrics stay unavailable.\n\n**Passing SMART is not a guarantee.** Inspect changing error counts and keep backups. Historical reallocation or CRC counts need context; the alert rules detect deterioration separately.\n\n**Scope:** only drives monitored by smartctl exporter appear here. The excluded unused SSD is intentionally absent."
          }
        }
